    "reviews": "\u201cThe Slovak national hero has finally received recognition in a quite solid video game, which can attract not only Slovaks.\u201d<br>7/10 \u2013 Sector<br><br>\u201cI definitely recommend to buy the Slovak title Juro Janosik!!!\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Gamefruit<br><br>\u201cThis is a very interesting RPG, in which you will learn a little more about Juraj J\u00e1no\u0161\u00edk. I recommend buying it.\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Kritiky<br>",
